    },
    "landing-note": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "page": "landing",
      "text": "Positioning: Syntropic137 turns your coding agents into repeatable workflows. Run them on any harness, see every step, and make every run better than the last. Page order: hero (the S rising from the run city) \u2192 What is it (write once, run anywhere, every run compounds) \u2192 01 Repeatable workflows \u2192 02 Any harness \u2192 03 Fully observable \u2192 04 Compounding improvement (the eval explorer) \u2192 use cases \u2192 why a platform \u2192 get started. Product numbers are sample data.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 1990,
      "y": 0
    },
    "landing-hero-blender": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "page": "landing",
      "text": "Hero art is now the Blender render (build_hero.py in the handoff folder's blender/). This is a preview-quality cloud render: grainy, no denoiser. The final comes from the Mac mini at 2560px with the denoiser, plus a 5-second clip that plays once. v3 on the right keeps the vector city hero for comparison.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 1990,
      "y": 360
    },
    "shipped-sample": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "page": "screens",
      "text": "\"Shipped by agents\" replaces the Live commits feed: commits, PRs opened, PRs merged, merge rate and repos touched over 14 days, each with a daily bar trend. The numbers are samples (this instance has no git events yet). The data comes from the GitHub events the triggers already receive, plus PRs created by runs.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": -480,
      "y": 0
    },
    "overview-iso": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "page": "screens",
      "w": 420,
      "x": -480,
      "y": 420,
      "text": "Overview heatmap is now an isometric city of days that scrolls back in time, like the Blender render: weeks come toward you, weekdays recede, older weeks sink into the fog on the left. Use the arrows, Now, or click a week in the strip below. In the build: trackpad and wheel scroll, drag, arrow keys and swipe on phone; render only visible weeks plus one each side; lazy-load older weeks; reduced motion jumps a week at a time. History outside Jul 25 to Aug 28 is sample data."
    },
    "overview-iso-phone": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "page": "phone",
      "w": 420,
