      "y": 420,
      "text": "Phone Overview: same scrolling city, 8 weeks visible. Swipe sideways in the build; the arrows and Now are the board stand-ins. The week strip shows the whole year with the visible window outlined. History outside Jul 25 to Aug 28 is sample data."
